<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Path Traversal - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>📂 Basic Path Traversal</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-medium">Medium</span><span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 20 pts</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>Read system files using ../ sequences. The application serves files from /documents/ directory. Break out and read /etc/passwd.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> File Reader</h2>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Available files:</label>
        <% files.forEach(function(f) { %><button onclick="readFile('<%= f %>')" style="margin:0.2rem; padding:0.3rem 0.8rem; background:var(--bg-card); border:1px solid var(--border-color); color:var(--neon-blue); border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer;"><%= f %></button><% }); %>
        <label style="margin-top:1rem;">Or enter filename:</label>
        <input type="text" id="fileInput" placeholder="../../../../etc/passwd" autocomplete="off">
        <button onclick="readFile(document.getElementById('fileInput').value)" class="btn">Read File</button>
      </div>
      <div id="fileResult" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
      <div class="code-block">Targets:
../../../../etc/passwd
../../../../etc/shadow
../../../../proc/self/environ
../../../../app/config.js
../../../../home/admin/.ssh/id_rsa</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('path-traversal','flagInput_pt','flagResult_pt'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_pt" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_pt" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    async function readFile(name) {
      const res = await fetch(`/labs/path-traversal/basic/read?file=${encodeURIComponent(name)}`);
      const data = await res.json();
      document.getElementById('fileResult').innerHTML = '<pre>'+JSON.stringify(data,null,2)+'</pre>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
